p('Black text states the approved framing, source-supported background, prospective methods or recorded exploratory findings. Red text identifies assumptions, missing information, illustrative numerical outcomes or conditional conclusions. Labels accompany color for grayscale printing. Replace red values only with traceable evidence; changing color alone does not verify a result.')
