p('The 880-row grounded simulation produced unseen macro-F1 0.543 for full random forest, 0.542 for the FT-style transformer and 0.574 for reduced logistic regression (Pagan, 2026b). These describe a designed simulation. Changes in data, representation, weighting and metric prevent interpreting them as directly comparable stages of one performance trajectory.')
